<title>UK: CRICKET-LANCASHIRE BEAT ESSEX BY 129 RUNS IN NATWEST FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LANCASHIRE BEAT ESSEX BY 129 RUNS IN NATWEST FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancahsire beat Essex by 129 runs in the final of the NatWest Trophy at Lord's on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Lancashire 186 in 60 overs, innings closed (J.Crawley 66). Essex 57 in 27.2 overs (G.Chapple 6-18, P.Martin 3-17).</p>
</text>
